plot(meuse.grid_sf[,"pred"], pch = 15, cex = 0.8, nbreaks = 20)   # Predictive mean
plot(meuse.grid_sf[,"pred_sd"], pch = 15, cex = 0.8, nbreaks = 20)# Predictive SD

### Multiscale spatial pattern/feature extraction
